#: debian-unstable
msgid ""
"Distribute freely, except: don\\*(Aqt remove my name from the source or "
"documentation (don\\*(Aqt take credit for my work), mark your changes "
"(don\\*(Aqt get me blamed for your possible bugs), don\\*(Aqt alter or "
